Package: MVMT
Type: Package
Title: Multivariate Multi-Trait Gene-Based Association Test
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ke", "Yu", email = "yuke123@stu.scu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a flexible framework for conducting gene-based 
    association tests across multiple traits using summary statistics and 
    LD matrices. The package reads GWAS summary statistics and per-gene LD 
    matrices, performs allele-flip quality control, and computes joint 
    chi-square statistics via simultaneous whitening to account for both 
    linkage disequilibrium among variants and correlation among traits.
